# Submission checkpoint: the retained controlled-RINE seed-42 head (17KB;
# it's only the trained fusion/classifier weights, not the frozen CLIP
# backbone, which downloads from Hugging Face on first run). Committed so a
# bare `git clone` + `pip install` + `python run_inference.py` works with no
# Drive access or manual staging.
!/artifacts/robustness/
!/artifacts/robustness/train-controlled-rine/
!/artifacts/robustness/train-controlled-rine/seed_42/
!/artifacts/robustness/train-controlled-rine/seed_42/best_50_50.pt

# Reports generated from experiments
*.log
wandb/
mlruns/
